# Rate Limiting And Admission Control

- Apply rate limiting intentionally to auth, public, and expensive endpoints.
- Use tenant-aware or actor-aware bucketing when the endpoint is tenant scoped.
- Reuse the existing preset and middleware utilities before creating new limit logic.
- Failure responses should be explicit and safe, with consistent headers when supported.
- Rate limiting is part of both security and cost control in this repo.
